        "id": 1373864
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-27T13:22:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So I reckon it\u0027s a (device) product decision whether this preopting should be active or not. If it\u0027s activated in the product mk file, it ought to be a build failure if the preopted files cannot be created for any reason, no?",
      "parentUuid": "f70e1b5c_198cefd1",
      "range": {
